<p>Your feet start to continuously produce carrion worms that are constantly crushed as you walk, passively increasing movement speed by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8%, 17%, 25%, 33%, 40%.</acronym></p><p>You can also activate this talent to instantly destroy more worms, letting you jump in range <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 8, 10</acronym> to visible terrain.</p><p>Upon landing you crush more worms, creating a radius 2 cone of gore; any creatures caught inside deals 70% less damage for one turn.</p><p>If at least 1 enemy is effected by the cone you gain an additional 20 insanity.</p>